# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and the working tree.
#
# Prettier (and `pnpm format:check` in CI) expects LF. With Git for Windows'
# default `core.autocrlf=true`, every checkout on Windows became CRLF and the
# format check reported ~100 files as unformatted, including on a Windows CI
# runner. Binary files are detected automatically by `text=auto`.
* text=auto eol=lf
